# 📈 TradeX - Stock Trading Platform

TradeX is a modern stock trading simulation platform built using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Chart.js.

This project simulates a real-time stock trading environment where users can:

- View live market stocks
- Buy and sell stocks
- Track portfolio performance
- Monitor wallet balance
- View transaction history
- Explore market news
- Analyze portfolio growth with charts

---

# 🚀 Features

## 🔐 Authentication UI
- Modern glassmorphism login page
- Interactive UI design
- Responsive layout

## 📊 Market Dashboard
- Stock market table
- Search functionality
- Buy/Sell operations
- Multiple stock listings

## 💼 Portfolio Management
- Portfolio tracking
- Profit/Loss calculation
- Wallet balance management
- Transaction history

## 📈 Analytics
- Portfolio growth chart using Chart.js
- Performance visualization

## 📰 News Section
- Market news updates
- Interactive dashboard navigation

## 🎨 UI Features
- Animated transitions
- Responsive design
- Modern dashboard interface
- Dynamic navigation tabs

